  "notes": "お{喋|しゃべ}り can be a noun, na-adjective, or suru verb.\n\nFORMS:\n- Noun: お{喋|しゃべ}り (chat, chatterbox)\n- Na-adjective: お{喋|しゃべ}りな (talkative)\n- Suru verb: お{喋|しゃべ}りする (to chat)\n\nNUANCE:\n- Can be positive (friendly chat) or negative (too talkative)\n- As description of a person, often implies they talk too much\n\nWRITING:\n- Usually written with お prefix\n- Can be written おしゃべり or お{喋|しゃべ}り",
